%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI found this six years ago, when I was still living in\nNagoya.\d%K%P
「差不多是六年前…\n我还在老家住的时候发现的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAny other child would have probably thought it was a\npicture of them, but I instantly realized it couldn't have\nbeen me.\d%K%P
「普通孩子的话，大概会以为是自己和爸爸的照片吧。\n但我马上就明白了，这并不是自己」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThere aren't actually any pictures of me as a child at\nall.\d%K%P
「其实…小时候的照片，我一张都没有哦」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI did think that was strange, so I tried asking our long-\ntime housekeeper about it.\d%K%P
「之前还觉得不可思议，就去问了在家里工作了\n很久的佣人…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dShe grew all pale and told me that my mother was one of\nthose people who still believed that photographs could\nsuck the soul out of a person. As a result, she forbade\nany pictures to be taken of me.\d%K%P
「然后，她的脸色就变了…\n告诉我『太太她，还相信拍照会吸走灵魂这样的事情，\n不允许大小姐被拍进照片』」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dEven for a child like me, that sounded way too fishy to\nbelieve.\d%K%P
「就算还是个孩子，也觉得这话十分没有可信度，\n也不可能去相信的…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dSo finding this picture came as a huge shock.\d%K%P
「在那里的这张照片…\n确实令我十分震惊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dMy father, who'd normally never show as much as a curl of\nthe lips when he came home, was now gently smiling at some\nother kid.\d%K%P
「偶尔回老家见到不苟言笑的父亲，\n在那张照片里，却温柔地看着那个不是我的孩子，\n即便不自然也是在笑着…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dFrom that day onwards, I started investigating that\npicture on my own. Where was the photo taken? Who was the\nchild? And the mother?\d%K%P
「从那天开始，我就瞒着父母调查了许多。\n拍照片的地点，照片里孩子的事情。\n以及、其母亲的事情」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThe place turned out to be a boarding house next to my\nfather's secondary residence in Hagimori. The name of the\nchild was Hinosaka Mitoko. Her mother: Hinosaka Honoka,\nthe landlord of the establishment.\d%K%P
「地点位于东荻守，是父亲住所隔壁的公寓。\n那孩子的名字是阳坂美都子。其母亲的名字是阳坂穗香。\n拍这张照片的人…可能是公寓的房主」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dShe was hired as a housekeeper pretty much as soon as my\nfather moved to his new residence.\d%K%P
「在父亲住进这所住处之后，\n她立刻就作为女佣，照料着父亲的日常生活」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThe neighbors didn't suspect anything about their\nrelationship, since it felt natural to hire someone who\nlived close, but...\d%K%P
「住在附近的人们，觉得是邻里之间的亲密，\n也没怀疑两人的关系…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dMitoko was born two years after my father's move.\d%K%P
「父亲在东萩守住的第二年，\n那孩子出生了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dFrom the womb of Ms. Honoka, who was already known to\neveryone in the neighborhood as a widow.\d%K%P
「是从那时本应已经成为寡妇的，\n穗香小姐的肚子里，呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
My room fell silent for a while as Himeo ended her speech.%K%P
姬绪小姐沉默下来，\n我的房间暂时重归寂静。%K%P
This shocking revelation left me unable to open my mouth,\nlet alone form coherent words.%K%P
因为，对于我来说，\n她的坦白实在太过于冲击，\n让我连张开嘴巴这种事情都做不到了。%K%P
Not even cliched lines like \dno way\d or \dthat's\nimpossible\d.%K%P
所以类似于『骗人』、『这不可能』这样的话，\n我也没说出口。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dDo you understand now...? Why I'm so obsessed with Toko?\d%K%P
「这样就明白了吧？\n我，对她…对小都子有所拘泥的原因」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dS-So, the reason you are trying to take Mitoko under your\nwing...\d%K%P
「那、那也就是说…\n你想要领养美都子是因为…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dYes, I want her to--\d%K%P
「是啊，我想把她…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTo call her a useless pig and turn her life into hell!\nYou still think that Mitoko didn't have enough!\d%K%P
「是为了骂她『你这没用的猪猡！』这种话吗？\n把美都子…当猪猡什么的！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dDon't be silly! Besides, the one being bullied here was\nthe older sister.\d%K%P
「不是那样的！\n我可不想做一个只会欺负妹妹的姐姐！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, so you were watching that show as well.\d%K%P
「啊，你果然看了啊」\n※译注：指肥皂剧《薔薇与牡丹》。%K%P
I thought she wouldn't miss something produced in Nagoya.%K%P
毕竟是当地拍摄，她应该不可能没看吧。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...I feel like this helped me understand exactly how you\nview me.\d%K%P
「…这样我算是清楚地知道了你是如何看待我的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry... I got momentarily confused because of the\nshock.\d%K%P
「对不起…\n因为太过震惊而有点混乱了」%K%P
I wondered why talking to her made me so inclined to make\nthese kind of jokes; I never even knew I had that in me.%K%P
倒不如说，和她交谈的时候，我仿佛丢失了自己原本的性格，\n不知为何想到了一个不错的梗。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThere's no way I could do anything bad to Toko... I mean,\nwhere could you even find a nicer girl?\d%K%P
「我不可能对小都子持有恶意…\n像她那么好的孩子，其它地方打着灯笼也找不到啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMs. Sawashima...\d%K%P
「泽嶋小姐…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAt first, I thought I'd just infiltrate the premises and\nobserve from afar what kind of person my little sister\nwas.\d%K%P
「最初是打算仔细观察我的妹妹到底是个怎样的人，\n才住到了附近」%K%P
Her expression turned grim, with a hint of wistfulness\nabout it.%K%P
然而现在，与往常不同，\n她很快就恢复了认真且略带苦闷的表情。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dBut pretty much the moment my things arrived, she came to\nmy house with an apron and rolled up sleeves.\d%K%P
「但是那个女孩，在我的搬家行李到达的同时，\n就卷着围裙的袖口，来到了我家」%K%P
The pain of guilt and the happiness of a fond memory were\nwarring across her face.%K%P
看起来十分痛苦，喘不过气来，\n同时却又显得十分怀念，十分开心。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dShe helped me carry my bags and clean the house; she even\nmade me tea and rice balls. ...As though I was moving into\nher house or something.\d%K%P
「十分拼命地帮我搬运行李，进行扫除，\n又为我泡好了茶，送来了饭团。\n…明明不是自己的搬家」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAhaha... I can easily imagine that.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…那情景真是容易想象啊」%K%P
The image of a small girl mustering all her strength to\ncarry a box, her dust-covered face breaking into a\nsatisfied grin with each completed task.%K%P
那里仿佛就有个拼命踮起脚，使尽浑身力量抬东西的小小女孩，\n脸上沾满了灰尘，却因为完成了一件令自己满意的工作而微微笑着。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI wasn't even given time to observe her. We became\nfriends the very first day I moved in.\d%K%P
「还没来得及认清她是个怎样的女孩，\n我们就在搬家来的那一天里成为了『好朋友』」%K%P
That sounded very much like Mitoko. In other words, our\nlittle landlord has not changed at all since back then.%K%P
总觉得，果然很有美都子的作风啊。\n也就是说那女孩，最起码从那个时候就一成不变啊。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI couldn't bring myself to reveal that she was the\nillegitimate child of my father. That she was someone my\nfamily would shun.\d%K%P
「所以，没能说出口。\n『你是我爸爸的私生子』什么的。\n『是本应该被我家冷落的孩子哦』什么的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThere's no way I could tell her...\d%K%P
「怎么可能说得出口啊…」%K%P
A child born from the affair of her mother and a rich man\nnext door.%K%P
是隔壁的伯伯，和母亲的私生子。%K%P
Even if you set aside personal feelings, her existence\ncould have very well been used to damage the reputation of\nthe Sawashimas on a national scale. As small as she was,\nthe significance of her existence was tremendous.%K%P
是个很可能会在泽嶋本家引起大骚动的，\n虽然个子小小的，却是个不同寻常并且有重要意义的孩子。%K%P
If Himeo had felt animosity towards Mitoko, she would have\nrevealed the truth to her right then and there.%K%P
这是个只要对美都子怀有负面情感，\n就能毫不犹豫说出口的事实。%K%P
But as she began to know more about Mitoko, she grew fond\nof her much like the residents of this boarding house...\nperhaps even more so...%K%P
但是，在很好地了解美都子之后，\n她和包括我在内的周围的人一样，不，比我们更甚地\n喜欢上了她，直到如今…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMs... Himeo...\d%K%P
「姬绪、小姐」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...What?\d%K%P
「…什么啊」%K%P
I changed the way I addressed her again.%K%P
我又一次，改变了对她的称呼。%K%P
I couldn't help breaking the rule after seeing her\ncornered like this.%K%P
『不能放着不管』当我这样想着的时候，\n就自然地打破了禁忌。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDon't you think it might be best to tell her everything,\nafter all?\d%K%P
「你没对美都子说吗？」%K%P
But Himeo didn't seem to mind or notice.%K%P
但是姬绪小姐，对于我违反规则的事，\n不知是否睁一只眼闭一只眼了…%K%P
The way I addressed her began to transcend the\nrelationship of two neighbors or coworkers, turning into\nsomething far more personal.%K%P
不论是对她的称呼方式，还是对于她的说话方式，\n都已经超过了邻居和直属上司这样特殊的关系，\n踏入了更加深的、更加私人的领域。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dNo way. There's just too much unnecessary risk involved.\nWhat if it only ends up hurting Toko's feelings?\d%K%P
「不行的。风险太大了。\n说不定会令小都子徒增悲伤的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I cannot deny that possibility, but...\d%K%P
「嘛，也不能否认有那种可能性就是了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAh, I see. It would be perfect for you if Toko started to\nhate me.\d%K%P
「啊啊这样啊，对你来说大概是许个愿就能实现的事。\n我遭到小都子讨厌什么的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo. That's not what I meant at all.\d%K%P
「不是的。\n我说的不是那种事」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThen what? Does hurting Toko make you happy or\nsomething?\d%K%P
「那，你想说什么呢？\n伤害了小都子，你就会开心么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI just think that Mitoko is able to handle it.\d%K%P
「即便如此，只要是美都子的话，\n我想她一定可以跨越的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBecause whatever else she may learn, I feel she would be\nhappy knowing she has you as an older sister.\d%K%P
「因为我相信对她来说，姬绪小姐是她的亲姐姐这件事，\n一定会让她十分开心的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko feels as if she has no family by her side right\nnow.\d%K%P
「现在的美都子，\n以为自己在这个世界上举目无亲了」%K%P
She wouldn't normally show it, but the shock and pain of\nhaving been abandoned by one's mother would not fade so\neasily.%K%P
平时虽然似乎感受不到，\n但被母亲抛弃的冲击，\n不是那么容易就能痊愈的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo I want Mitoko to know that her family is watching over\nher. That someone who loves her dearly is right here by\nher side.\d%K%P
「所以我希望美都子\n她能知道亲人就在附近守护着她…\n最爱她的人就在她身边」%K%P
There were times when we came back late and Mitoko told us\nshe was already asleep, blaming the redness of her eyes on\nthe time.%K%P
短短的一瞬间…\n我也是姬绪小姐也是，就像是晚上工作到很晚，\n辩解着『已经睡着啦』一样，眼睛通红通红的。%K%P
I never want to see her like that again. If Himeo could\ntruly save Mitoko, I was confident in my desire to take\nher hand.%K%P
那样的美都子，本来永远都不想看到的。\n若是姬绪小姐，能够拯救她的话，\n如今我便不会再犹豫，抓住面前的这只手。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Are you acknowledging me as the person closest to\nToko?\d%K%P
「…我成为小都子心目中的第一，\n这你能接受吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf you are her sister, then of course.\d%K%P
「你是她的姐姐，这是理所当然的吧？」%K%P
I knew she would probably turn violent if I actually took\nher hand, so for now I just looked at her with grateful\neyes.%K%P
果真抓住这只手的话，一定会背负各种骂名，\n虽说实际上仅限于认真观望这件事的人。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAm I supposed to take that as a declaration of defeat?\d%K%P
「这是，败北宣言？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, at least I lost fair and square.\d%K%P
「不过，这是很痛快的败北」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAre you going to be okay even if I said I wanted to take\nher into our family? Bring her back to Nagoya with me?\d%K%P
「即便我说想领养小都子你也同意？\n即便我说想把她带回老家你也同意？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNow I can believe in you.\d%K%P
「现在的话我能够相信」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI...\d%K%P
「你…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf you are a blood relative to Mitoko, then it's\nsomething I would ask myself.\d%K%P
「你是美都子的骨肉至亲，\n对我来说正求之不得」%K%P
After living under the same roof and working together with\nher for a month, there was one thing I could say with\nabsolute certainty.%K%P
同在一个屋檐下生活，在一起工作，\n一个月以来循环往复，然后我就明白了。%K%P
She might be brash and ignorant of the real world; she\nmight come up with all sorts of silly schemes to reach her\ngoals, but...%K%P
她是个为了不让世间知道，不让对方知道，\n只为能够实现自己目的，\n就会不择手段的人。%K%P
...the source of her motivation has always been love:\ncrude and naively straightforward in nature, but as\ngenuine and honest as love could be.%K%P
而这个行为又必定是由对某人的爱而支撑着，\n又笨拙，又坦率，无论何时都很认真。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI and the other tenants can only support Mitoko during\nthe day. But you're able to have her back all the time.\d%K%P
「我和公寓的大家，\n都只能给白天的美都子增添活力。\n但是姬绪小姐的话，无论何时都能在她身边」%K%P
They could wash each other's backs, have long talks before\nfalling asleep... Himeo could fill Ms. Honoka's position\nfar better than me.%K%P
搓背什么的，睡前私语什么的…\n能够在名义和实际方面都填补上穗香小姐位置的，\n就只有这唯一的“姐姐”。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo please, tell her. Tell her that you are her real\nsister!\d%K%P
「所以请你说出来吧。\n把你是美都子亲姐姐的事告诉她！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI imagine it might be a little awkward at first, but I'm\nsure she'll start calling you \dSis\d eventually!\d%K%P
「刚开始的确可能会遇到许许多多的事…\n但是，总有一天她会叫你『姐姐』的！」%K%P
If Mitoko wasn't really alone, I wanted her to know it.%K%P
我想让美都子切实感受到，\n其实自己并不是独身一人。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'll help you convince her. I can even take on the duty\nof waiting for Ms. Honoka to come back.\d%K%P
「我也会一起说服的。\n可能的话，在公寓里等穗香小姐的任务，\n就交给我好了」%K%P
I wanted both the strong, energetic, and nosy Mitoko of\nthe day, and the selfish, fragile Mitoko of the night to\nbe equally happy.%K%P
无论是白天那活蹦乱跳精神十足多管闲事的美都子，\n还是晚上那个又任性又老实被惯坏的美都子，\n无论她变成怎样我都想让她幸福。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo please, Himeo. Only think about Mitoko and yourself\nfrom now on.\d%K%P
「所以请姬绪小姐就仅仅考虑\n美都子的幸福和自己的幸福吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
And, well...%K%P
顺口就…这样说出来了。%K%P
I wanted this person -- who suppressed herself because of\nher feelings for Mitoko -- to be just as happy.%K%P
眼前这个极其喜欢着美都子却压抑着自己的人，\n我也希望她能变得幸福。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
No doubt slightly unsettled by my intense gaze, Himeo\nlowered her head and fixed her eyes on her hands.%K%P
像是要避开我那笔直朝前的视线一般，\n姬绪小姐微妙地俯下去，看向她自己的手。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...You're hurting me.\d%K%P
「…好痛」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dCould you at least not squeeze so hard?\d%K%P
「不要这么用力…握着啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh?! When did this happen?!\d%K%P
「啊啊，什么时候！？」%K%P
I followed her gaze to find my hands clutching hers.%K%P
俯视的视线前方，\n是被我的手交握着的，她自己的手，这让她叫苦不迭。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry, I swear I was trying to control myself, but\nbefore I knew it...\d%K%P
「对、对不起，\n确实有注意过的…但不知不觉就…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHmm? If you were indeed trying to control yourself as you\nsay, does that mean you actually wanted to take my hand?\nAs in, not unconsciously, but as a deliberate action.\d%K%P
「说是有注意过，\n其实是想握我的手吧？\n是无意的，还是有意的？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Ah, um... That's... Uh...\d%K%P
「诶？啊，不，那是，那个…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
