And that whole story about Himeo's mother being afraid of\nphotographs was also true; apparently, she didn't even\nhave any of her own.%K%P
顺便说一下，\n姬绪小姐的母亲是真的很讨厌拍照，\n岂止是孩子，自己的照片也一张都没有。%K%P
