「是、是这样…吗」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAbsolutely. I was planning to tell you next week at\nschool.\d%K%P
「是这样哦。\n本来是准备在下周座谈会上才提出的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I guess I got ahead of myself a little.\d%K%P
「…是不是过早了啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI am not going to complain about the fact that you're\naware of my plans. If anything, I'm truly grateful for\nyour swift response.\d%K%P
「我并不是要对老师知道我志愿的事情说三道四的。\n非但不会那样，我还要向提早为我行动的您表达感谢呢」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Then why are you being so indignantly polite?\d%K%P
「…那样的话为什么要使用这种瘆人的敬语啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLike I said, I don't plan to complain. But I would\nappreciate it if you could kindly spill the beans and tell\nme how you came to know this information.\d%K%P
「虽然不会对已经知道的事情说三道四，\n但我还是想要明确您得到情报的事？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEven your tone is all over the place now...\d%K%P
「而且说话方式也变得奇怪了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...When did you meet?\d%K%P
「…什么时候见面的？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dW-With whom?\d%K%P
「和、和谁？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Snitch.\d%K%P
「告密者」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI don't believe such abstract wording is enough for me to\nfigure out who you meant. Um, when it comes to language\nand grammar, you should try to imagine yourself in the\nshoes of the other person, and...\d%K%P
「我认为这么抽象的比喻是没办法弄清真相的哦。\n国语的学习方法啊，是只要一次站在出题立场看看的话…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Last Saturday, at our usual spot in Shanzeriya.\d%K%P
「………上周六。\n照例在香泽里拉」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHmmmm... Your usual place. I see.\d%K%P
「呼唔唔唔～嗯。\n这样啊。『照例』呢」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI keep wondering about this, but...\d%K%P
「我平时就在想了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAbout what?\d%K%P
「想什么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhy do you keep getting angry over me and Osa... I mean,\nyour guardian meeting each other?\d%K%P
「为什么你会这么生气呢？\n我和理…！？\n我和你的监护人每次见面的时候」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm not angry, okay?! It just rubs me the wrong way\nbecause you're always doing it behind my back, okay?!!\d%K%P
「我才没有生气呢（もん）。\n只是你们鬼鬼祟祟的，反而让我在意了啊（もん）」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWow... I think I pissed her off for real now. He said I\nshould watch out when she starts adding \dokay\d to the end\nof her every sentence.\d%K%P
「唔哇…在生气啊。\n『もん』和『じゃん』的确是关键词啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy do you keep hiding things from me, Osamu? You're\nalways like that, and I...\d%K%P
「为什么又瞒着我啊，理君。\n就因为是这样的事啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUm, Mitoko...?\d%K%P
「那个，美都子？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat?\d%K%P
「什么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHe might be your guardian, but I'm not sure if that\nautomatically means you have the right to know everything\nabout his private affairs.\d%K%P
「就算他是你的监护人，\n我觉得你是不是干涉他的私事过头了？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHmm... So, you're saying that you two meeting up was a\nprivate affair, then.\d%K%P
「哼嗯…果然是私事呢。\n和理君单独见面什么的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI see... It didn't matter whether he was my guardian or\nnot. You just had personal business with Osamu. I see.\nOkay.\d%K%P
「这样啊…和是我的监护人这类事没关系啊。\n只是，找理君个人方面的事啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Yes. Is there a problem?\d%K%P
「…是啊，有意见吗？」%K%P
