%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dC-Control...?! I'm not doing anything crazy like that,\nokay?!\d%K%P
「束、束缚…我才没有做那么蛮横的事呢！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHe may be a bit of a substitute parent to you right now,\nbut he's neither old enough, nor in the position to be\nable to dedicate his whole life to you.\d%K%P
「就算是作为你的抚养人，从他的岁数和立场上来看，\n他还不至于要为了你而放弃人生吧？」%K%P
