%LC美都子
\dI know that much! And our relationship is none of your\nbusiness!\d%K%P
「那种事情我知道的。\n我才不想让老师来评论我和理君的事」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIn that case, I can just repeat the same thing to you.\nOur relationship is none of your business, Mitoko.\d%K%P
