%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dY-You keep dismissing my points with stupid semantics!\d%K%P
「不、不要老是抓别人的话柄啊！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMitoko, you clearly don't treat Osamu the way a child\nwould her guardian.\d%K%P
「美都子，从你对于理的态度来说，\n完全看不出是对于一个监护人应有的态度」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd you clearly don't treat Osamu like a teacher would,\neither!\d%K%P
「老师对于理君的态度才是，\n完全看不出是对于一个家长的态度嘛！」%K%P
