%LC理
\dI won't. We only have thirty minutes until the meeting.\d%K%P
「不会等的。\n与对方的约定时间只剩３０分钟了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dW-We can just make a phone call, and...\d%K%P
「那、那提前打个电话的话」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI already did, but their chief is busy and can't make it\nunless it's right now.\d%K%P
「电话已经打了。\n但是对方的科长似乎之后的安排也很紧张」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dA-A managing director is coming to meet him in person.\nAnd via train, no less?!\d%K%P
「我、我们这边的董事亲自去拜访也这样？\n而且还是徒步和坐电车去的！」%K%P
Our managing director's business trip, originally planned\nfor 4PM, was jeopardized by a board meeting that grew\nlate. To avoid getting stuck in traffic, we had to rely on\nmore worldly means of travel.%K%P
今天泽嶋董事因为最后预定在下午四点之前出差，\n拖延了前面的会议，因而为了避开交通堵塞，\n被迫使用了一般的交通工具。%K%P
...However, it barely took ten minutes of walking for my\nsuperior to start complaining.%K%P
…虽然这么说，开始走十分钟之后，\n就听见了我这上司的诅咒声。%K%P
You should work out more, Himeo.%K%P
姬绪小姐体力还真差啊。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, I forgot to tell you, but I never announced it would\nbe the managing director making the visit.\d%K%P
「啊～，忘记说了，\n我可没提到我们的泽嶋董事会亲自去拜访」%K%P
