%LC理
\dI mean, they would never be honest with someone that high\nabove them in rank. And for that reason, today you'll be a\ntrainee accompanying me. Make sure to follow my orders\nwithout ruining the act.\d%K%P
「那样做的话，对方就不会说真心话了啊。\n到了那边的话，你就算是刚进来实习的新职员了。\n请你一定要服从我的指示」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dY-You tricked me!\d%K%P
「你、你骗了我吧！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI tricked the other side too, so you don't need to feel\nbad about it.\d%K%P
「对方也被骗了，彼此彼此吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dYou're doing this because of that thing I did to you with\nToko earlier, right? You got tricked like a big old fool,\nand now you're hatching all these petty schemes to get\nback at me!\d%K%P
「你这是对上次小都子那件事的报复吧！\n就算自己被骗得体无完肤了，这种纠缠不休的报复也太…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWe have to hurry! Pick up the pace!\d%K%P
「要抓紧时间了！\n来，跑起来！」%K%P
That wasn't among my plans, but now that she mentioned\nit...%K%P
虽然完全没这个打算，\n但既然被她指出来了，我也得回应她的期待才行。%K%P
