%LC理
\dIf you say so. You can do all that to your heart's\ncontent once you reach the top through your own strength.\nBut for now, please walk, Ms. Trainee.\d%K%P
「是是，如果你是靠实力登顶的话，\n随时想做就做吧。\n好了，但是现在请给我走路，花瓶小姐！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dNo. That's it. I can't. My legs refuse to move.\d%K%P
「我受够了，已经不行了，脚已经没办法向前迈了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhere have you seen a managing director just sitting down\nin the middle of a busy road?!\d%K%P
「明明是个董事，请不要蹲在路边！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI'm just a trainee, anyway.\d%K%P
「反正是个花瓶～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhich is even more of a reason to keep up appearances.\d%K%P
「是花瓶的话，就请漂亮一点」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dUh... Um... Ah, dammit! I've got no good comeback for\nthat!\d%K%P
「那个，那个…\n啊啊，够了！\n想不出好的回击了～！」%K%P
That was hardly the behavior I would have expected from a\nlady born to an influential family. Or an adult in\ngeneral, for that matter.%K%P
这是泽嶋家的千金大小姐作为公司董事应有的态度么…%K%P
I felt like she was starting to act more and more childish\nlately. I wasn't sure if I could even call her a\nuniversity student at this point.%K%P
倒不如说，最近她这种与年龄不相符的态度，\n已经屡见不鲜了么…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPlease, snap out of it already. We're going to be late.\d%K%P
「好了，不要说任性的话了。\n真会赶不上的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThen maybe you should treat me with a touch more\nconsideration.\d%K%P
「…那样的话就对我温柔一点啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dApparently, I don't compromise when it comes to work.\d%K%P
「我是在工作上不会妥协的人」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWeren't you the one saying something about a carrot and a\nstick? You're going to work me to death if you keep this\nup.\d%K%P
「最近，糖和鞭子的分配是不是渐渐变了？\n背上已经伤痕累累了啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat kind of twisted metaphor is that?!\d%K%P
「请不要做讨厌的比喻！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI want something sweet.\d%K%P
「我想要甜的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI think I might have some candy in my bag.\d%K%P
「包里有润喉糖…」%K%P
