\dThat would be grand, thank you very much.\d%K%P
「好的，那就请多关照了～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDon't you have any pride, Ms. Managing Director?\d%K%P
「自尊去哪儿了啊，董事…」%K%P
Managing Director Sawashima extended her hand towards me\nwith no hesitation.%K%P
蹲在路边的泽嶋董事，\n毫不犹豫地向我伸出了手。%K%P
Taking a firm hold of her soft, small hand with my own, I\npulled her back to her feet.%K%P
走投无路的我，\n只好握住那只纤细柔软的手，\n用尽全力拉了上来。%K%P
