%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI understand. I shall be heading for the Terrace House\nHinosaka, then.\d%K%P
「知道了。\n那么，就去Terrace House阳之坂了」%K%P
Lately, rumors of her naive cluelessness began to spread\nnot only among the executives, but to the regular\nemployees as well.%K%P
最近，她那『哪来的小～孩』似的做法，\n不仅对于干部，甚至很平常地渗透到了全公司职员的想法里了。\n※译注：哪来的小孩，《聪明的一休》里的角色。%K%P
However, since she neither showed indignation when those\nrumors reached her ears, nor denied her lack of\nexperience, there were very few people who actually\ndisliked her.%K%P
不过，她在问那个的时候，\n因为贯彻着『不畏惧，不虚张声势，不假装知道』的原则，\n所以在公司里的评价绝不差。%K%P
Some of the younger staff even started inviting her for\ndrinks.%K%P
最近也是，时常会被邀请去和年轻职员喝酒。%K%P
However, since she was adamant about not going anywhere\nwithout her secretary, none of these invitations had any\nchance of coming to fruition.%K%P
…但是『秘书不同行的话就不去』明确这样声明了，\n所以那个交流会至今也没实现。%K%P
Considering her comically weak tolerance to alcohol, that\nwas probably for the best.%K%P
嘛，她岂止是不能喝酒，\n连酒气都不能吸入啊。%K%P
