The season had already shifted to mid-autumn; you could\nbarely even hear the sound of insects from beyond the\nwindow, yet the heat of the Indian summer still raged on\nindoors.%K%P
窗外的虫声也渐渐微弱的秋日之际，\n这间屋子仅限今日是小阳春一般的晚上…%K%P
