「一般来说，不论信还是不信，这都是不可思议呢。\n不是自己创业的大学生做董事什么的」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWhat should I do...? Should I buy more, or sell\neverything now? I got my hands on some incredible inside\ninformation, but it's so messed up I've no idea how to\nutilize it.\d%K%P
