When Mitoko and Asami met us outside the car, we felt an\nalmost viscous animosity in the air right away, and could\ndo nothing but tremble in fear.%K%P
被美都子和不知为何在这里的麻实迎接的我们，\n都感受到了当时不太对劲的气氛，战栗了起来。%K%P
