%LC姬绪
\dYeah. I was sort of hired by the same place as Osamu.\d%K%P
『是啊。就是就职了。在理先生的公司里』%K%P
Or rather, the only one that felt panicked was me. Himeo\nsimply reported everything the way it was, wearing her\nnormal, composed smile.%K%P
…本以为是这样，不过战栗起来的人似乎只有我一个，\n姬绪小姐很简单地就把上个月开始作为我的上司\n而被录用的事情坦白了。%K%P
...Although she made me swear countless times not to tell\nanyone.%K%P
…明明多次不要我说出去的。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
