%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Eh? That's...\d%K%P
「诶？诶？那是…」%K%P
I could see Himeo grinning in an oddly gentle way behind\nMitoko.%K%P
而且姬绪小姐的表情显得非常温柔，脸上还带着微微笑意。%K%P
Almost like she was urging me to take the easy road and go\nalong with her story.%K%P
那样的表情满溢出的是\n『好啦好啦，配合着说吧。那样才更好哦？』这样的话语。%K%P
