How could I have been so ignorant and disrespectful...? I\ntruly was a failure as a member of Japanese society. That\nmust've been why he kept giving me that troubled look!%K%P
多么失礼…不配作为社会人啊。\n感情最近他老是一副困扰的表情，原来是因为这个啊！%K%P
